## Native Task Contract

Your input is a compiled task payload on stdin with fields such as:
- task id, title, wave, depends_on
- read_scope and write_scope
- approved plan context
- retry context from previous failures when present

Your output must be a JSON object on stdout:
{
  "status": "complete",
  "summary": "what you changed",
  "changes_made": [
    {
      "file": "path/to/file",
      "description": "what changed",
      "task_id": "CHANGE-001"
    }
  ],
  "issues_encountered": []
}

If you cannot complete the task, return a JSON object with a failing summary and enough
detail for deterministic retry classification.
